 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "bcb82cc3-dea6-4afe-ab63-c922acceef21",
   "name": "📌 SETUP GUIDE",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    180,
    60
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "color": 4,
    "content": "## 📰 AgentKit · 04 — Daily Researcher\n**Roz subah 8 baje: top tech news ka AI digest seedha Telegram pe.**\n\n**Setup (8 min):**\n1. **Schedule** — 🕗 node pe time set hai (8:00). Change karna ho to node kholo.\n2. **RSS** — CONFIG `rss_url`: default Hacker News frontpage. Apni niche ka RSS lagao (e.g. niche blog).\n3. **AI + Telegram + Sheets** — pehle wali tarah credentials + IDs.\n4. **Active** karo → kal subah digest hazir.\n\n**Flow:** Schedule → RSS → top stories filter → AI digest (Roman Urdu ya English) → Telegram → log.\n**Pro tip:** `digest_language`: `Roman Urdu` likho to digest Roman Urdu mein aayega.\n",
    "height": 700,
    "width": 620
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "3823e39a-a488-4f16-aaaf-46e4d27872c7",
   "name": "🕗 Daily 8AM",
